{"seq":4,"slug":"cicd-automation","title":"CI/CD 自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-publishing/cicd-automation","wordCount":1026,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-自动化\">CI/CD 自动化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CI/CD（持续集成/持续部署）将 Unity 项目的构建、测试和发布流程自动化，消除人工操作瓶颈。Unity 项目的 CI/CD 有其特殊性：构建需要 Unity Editor 许可证、构建时间长（30 分钟到数小时）、产出物是平台特定的安装包、需要处理大量二进制资源文件。成熟的 CI/CD 管线可以将团队从重复的手动构建中解放出来，确保每次发布的可重复性和一致性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Git Push] --&gt; B[CI 触发]&#10;    B --&gt; C[代码检查]&#10;    C --&gt; D[单元测试]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Unity 构建]&#10;    E --&gt; F{构建成功?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[产物上传]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[通知失败]&#10;    G --&gt; I[分发测试]&#10;    I --&gt; J[商店发布]&#10;    K[License 管理] --&gt; E\">graph LR\n    A[Git Push] --&gt; B[CI 触发]\n    B --&gt; C[代码检查]\n    C --&gt; D[单元测试]\n    D --&gt; E[Unity 构建]\n    E --&gt; F{构建成功?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[产物上传]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[通知失败]\n    G --&gt; I[分发测试]\n    I --&gt; J[商店发布]\n    K[License 管理] --&gt; E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CI/CD 平台</th>\n<th>Unity 支持</th>\n<th>自托管 Runner</th>\n<th>价格模型</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Unity Cloud Build</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>按座位收费</td>\n<td>零配置、官方支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub Actions</td>\n<td>通过 GameCI</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>按分钟计费</td>\n<td>生态丰富、GitHub 集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitLab CI</td>\n<td>通过 GameCI</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>免费额度</td>\n<td>自托管友好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jenkins</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n<td>完全可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Buildkite</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>按用量</td>\n<td>高并发支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-工作流\">GitHub Actions 工作流</h2><p>GitHub Actions 配合 GameCI 社区维护的 Action 是目前最流行的 Unity CI/CD 方案。GameCI 提供了预配置的 Docker 镜像，内含指定版本的 Unity Editor，支持 Linux/macOS/Windows 构建环境。</p>\n<p>核心流程分为三个阶段：测试（Test）、构建（Build）、部署（Deploy）。Unity License 通过 GitHub Secrets 以环境变量形式注入，支持个人版（Personal）和专业版（Professional）许可证激活。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Unity CI/CD Pipeline&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main, develop]&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;env:&#10;  UNITY_VERSION: 2022.3.20f1&#10;  PROJECT_PATH: .&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  test:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          lfs: true&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          path: Library&#10;          key: Library-${{ hashFiles(&#39;Assets/**&#39;, &#39;Packages/**&#39;, &#39;ProjectSettings/**&#39;) }}&#10;          restore-keys: Library-&#10;&#10;      - uses: game-ci/unity-test-runner@v4&#10;        env:&#10;          UNITY_LICENSE: ${{ secrets.UNITY_LICENSE }}&#10;        with:&#10;          projectPath: ${{ env.PROJECT_PATH }}&#10;          unityVersion: ${{ env.UNITY_VERSION }}&#10;          testMode: all&#10;          artifactsPath: TestResults&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        if: always()&#10;        with:&#10;          name: test-results&#10;          path: TestResults&#10;&#10;  build-android:&#10;    needs: test&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          lfs: true&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          path: Library&#10;          key: Library-${{ hashFiles(&#39;Assets/**&#39;, &#39;Packages/**&#39;, &#39;ProjectSettings/**&#39;) }}&#10;&#10;      - uses: game-ci/unity-builder@v4&#10;        env:&#10;          UNITY_LICENSE: ${{ secrets.UNITY_LICENSE }}&#10;        with:&#10;          projectPath: ${{ env.PROJECT_PATH }}&#10;          unityVersion: ${{ env.UNITY_VERSION }}&#10;          targetPlatform: Android&#10;          androidKeystoreName: user.keystore&#10;          androidKeystoreBase64: ${{ secrets.ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64 }}&#10;          androidKeystorePass: ${{ secrets.ANDROID_KEYSTORE_PASS }}&#10;          androidKeyaliasName: ${{ secrets.ANDROID_KEYALIAS_NAME }}&#10;          androidKeyaliasPass: ${{ secrets.ANDROID_KEYALIAS_PASS }}&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          name: android-build&#10;          path: build/Android&#10;&#10;  build-ios:&#10;    needs: test&#10;    runs-on: macos-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          lfs: true&#10;&#10;      - uses: game-ci/unity-builder@v4&#10;        env:&#10;          UNITY_LICENSE: ${{ secrets.UNITY_LICENSE }}&#10;        with:&#10;          projectPath: ${{ env.PROJECT_PATH }}&#10;          unityVersion: ${{ env.UNITY_VERSION }}&#10;          targetPlatform: iOS&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          name: ios-build&#10;          path: build/iOS\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Unity CI/CD Pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">develop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></s