 style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          lfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">game-ci/unity-builder@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          UNITY_LICENSE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.UNITY_LICENSE }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          projectPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ env.PROJECT_PATH }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          unityVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ env.UNITY_VERSION }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          targetPlatform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">iOS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/upload-artifact@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ios-build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">build/iOS</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Library 缓存是加速 Unity CI 构建的关键。Unity 在首次导入资源时生成 Library 文件夹中的缓存数据，后续构建可直接复用。通过 actions/cache 配合资源文件哈希作为 key，可以显著缩短构建时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动化测试集成\">自动化测试集成</h2><p>Unity Test Framework 基于 NUnit，支持 EditMode 测试和 PlayMode 测试。在 CI 管线中运行测试可以在构建前捕获逻辑错误和回归问题。GameCI 的 unity-test-runner 自动收集测试结果并生成 JUnit 格式的报告。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using NUnit.Framework;&#10;using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.TestTools;&#10;using System.Collections;&#10;&#10;[TestFixture]&#10;public class PlayerHealthTests&#10;{&#10;    private PlayerHealth _health;&#10;&#10;    [SetUp]&#10;    public void Setup()&#10;    {&#10;        var go = new GameObject();&#10;        _health = go.AddComponent&lt;PlayerHealth&gt;();&#10;        _health.Initialize(100);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    [TearDown]&#10;    public void Teardown()&#10;    {&#10;        Object.DestroyImmediate(_health.gameObject);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    [Test]&#10;    public void TakeDamage_ReducesHealth()&#10;    {&#10;        _health.TakeDamage(30);&#10;        Assert.AreEqual(70, _health.CurrentHealth);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    [Test]&#10;    public void TakeDamage_DoesNotGoBelowZero()&#10;    {&#10;        _health.TakeDamage(150);&#10;        Assert.AreEqual(0, _health.CurrentHealth);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    [UnityTest]&#10;    public IEnumerator Regeneration_RestoresHealthOverTime()&#10;    {&#10;        _health.TakeDamage(50);&#10;        _health.StartRegeneration(10f);&#10;&#10;        yield return new WaitForSeconds(2f);&#10;&#10;        Assert.Greater(_health.CurrentHealth, 50);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using NUnit.Framework;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.TestTools;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[TestFixture]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class PlayerHealthTests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private PlayerHealth _health;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SetUp]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Setup()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var go = new GameObject();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _health = go.AddComponent&#x3C;PlayerHealth>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _health.Initialize(100);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [TearDown]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Teardown()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Object.DestroyImmediate(_health.gameObject);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void TakeDamage_ReducesHealth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _health.TakeDamage(30);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Assert.AreEqual(70, _health.CurrentHealth);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void TakeDamage_DoesNotGoBelowZero()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _health.TakeDamage(150);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Assert.AreEqual(0, _health.CurrentHealth);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [UnityTest]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public IEnumerator Regeneration_RestoresHealthOverTime()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _health.TakeDamage(50);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _health.StartRegeneration(10f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        yield return new WaitForSeconds(2f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Assert.Greater(_health.CurrentHealth, 50);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 测试金字塔&#10;        A[E2E 测试] --&gt; B[集成测试 PlayMode]&#10;        B --&gt; C[单元测试 EditMode]&#10;    end&#10;    C --&gt; D[逻辑验证、数据处理]&#10;    B --&gt; E[组件交互、物理、协程]&#10;    A --&gt; F[完整游戏流程]&#10;    G[CI 管线] --&gt; C&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    H[手动测试] --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    subgraph 测试金字塔\n        A[E2E 测试] --&gt; B[集成测试 PlayMode]\n        B --&gt; C[单元测试 EditMode]\n    end\n    C --&gt; D[逻辑验证、数据处理]\n    B --&gt; E[组件交互、物理、协程]\n    A --&gt; F[完整游戏流程]\n    G[CI 管线] --&gt; C\n    G --&gt; B\n    H[手动测试] --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"版本管理与发布自动化\">版本管理与发布自动化</h2><p>自动化版本管理确保每次构建有唯一的版本标识，方便追踪问题和回滚。常见策略是使用语义化版本（SemVer）配合构建号自增。在 CI 环境中，可以通过 Git 标签触发发布构建，自动设置版本号并推送到应用商店。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEditor;&#10;using UnityEditor.Build;&#10;using UnityEditor.Build.Reporting;&#10;using System;&#10;&#10;public class VersionManager : IPreprocessBuildWithReport&#10;{&#10;    public int callbackOrder =&gt; -1;&#10;&#10;    public void OnPreprocessBuild(BuildReport report)&#10;    {&#10;        string version = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(&#10;            &quot;BUILD_VERSION&quot;) ?? &quot;0.0.1&quot;;&#10;        string buildNumber = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(&#10;            &quot;BUILD_NUMBER&quot;) ?? &quot;1&quot;;&#10;&#10;        PlayerSettings.bundleVersion = version;&#10;&#10;        switch (report.summary.platform)&#10;        {&#10;            case BuildTarget.Android:&#10;                PlayerSettings.Android.bundleVersionCode =&#10;                    int.Parse(buildNumber);&#10;                break;&#10;            case BuildTarget.iOS:&#10;                PlayerSettings.iOS.buildNumber = buildNumber;&#10;                break;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static string GenerateVersion(&#10;        string branch, int runNumber)&#10;    {&#10;        if (branch == &quot;main&quot;)&#10;            return $&quot;1.0.{runNumber}&quot;;&#10;        if (branch.StartsWith(&quot;release/&quot;))&#10;            return branch.Replace(&quot;release/&quot;, &quot;&quot;) +&#10;                   $&quot;.{runNumber}&quot;;&#10;        return $&quot;0.0.{runNumber}-dev&quot;;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEditor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEditor.Build;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEditor.Build.Reporting;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class VersionManager : IPreprocessBuildWithReport</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int callbackOrder => -1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void OnPreprocessBuild(BuildReport report)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        string version = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"BUILD_VERSION\") ?? \"0.0.1\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        string buildNumber = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"BUILD_NUMBER\") ?? \"1\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PlayerSettings.bundleVersion = version;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        switch (report.summary.platform)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case BuildTarget.Android:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                PlayerSettings.Android.bundleVersionCode =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    int.Parse(buildNumber);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case BuildTarget.iOS:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                PlayerSettings.iOS.buildNumber = buildNumber;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static string GenerateVersion(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        string branch, int runNumber)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (branch == \"main\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return $\"1.0.{runNumber}\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (branch.StartsWith(\"release/\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return branch.Replace(\"release/\", \"\") +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                   $\".{runNumber}\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return $\"0.0.{runNumber}-dev\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发布渠道</th>\n<th>自动化工具</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>审核流程</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Google Play</td>\n<td>Fastlane supply</td>\n<td>Git 标签 v*.*.*</td>\n<td>自动审核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>App Store</td>\n<td>Fastlane deliver</td>\n<td>Git 标签 v*.*.*</td>\n<td>人工审核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Steam</td>\n<td>steamcmd</td>\n<td>develop 分支</td>\n<td>Steamworks 审核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部测试</td>\n<td>Firebase App Distribution</td>\n<td>每次 PR 合并</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web</td>\n<td>S3/CDN 上传</td>\n<td>main 分支推送</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"构建缓存与加速策略\">构建缓存与加速策略</h2><p>Unity 项目的 CI 构建时间通常在 30-90 分钟，对于大型项目甚至超过 2 小时。构建加速是 CI/CD 管线优化的核心课题。除了 Library 缓存外，还有多种加速手段可以显著缩短构建时间。</p>\n<p>Unity Accelerator 是官方提供的资源导入缓存服务，团队成员共享同一个 Accelerator 实例，任何一台机器导入过的资源都可以被其他机器直接复用。在 CI 环境中部署 Accelerator 可以将首次构建后的增量构建时间缩短 50-80%。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public static class CIBuildOptimizer&#10;{&#10;    public static void ConfigureForCI()&#10;    {&#10;        EditorPrefs.SetString(&#10;            &quot;CacheServerIPAddress&quot;, &quot;accelerator.internal:10443&quot;);&#10;        EditorPrefs.SetInt(&quot;CacheServerMode&quot;, 2);&#10;&#10;        EditorSettings.spritePackerMode =&#10;            SpritePackerMode.AlwaysOnAtlas;&#10;        EditorSettings.asyncShaderCompilation = false;&#10;&#10;        PlayerSettings.stripEngineCode = true;&#10;        PlayerSettings.SetManagedStrippingLevel(&#10;            BuildTargetGroup.Android,&#10;            ManagedStrippingLevel.Medium);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static void CleanupBeforeBuild()&#10;    {&#10;        AssetDatabase.ReleaseCachedFileHandles();&#10;        GC.Collect();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public static class CIBuildOptimizer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static void ConfigureForCI()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EditorPrefs.SetString(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"CacheServerIPAddress\", \"accelerator.internal:10443\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EditorPrefs.SetInt(\"CacheServerMode\", 2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EditorSettings.spritePackerMode =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            SpritePackerMode.AlwaysOnAtlas;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        EditorSettings.asyncShaderCompilation = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PlayerSettings.stripEngineCode = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PlayerSettings.SetManagedStrippingLevel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            BuildTargetGroup.Android,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ManagedStrippingLevel.Medium);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static void CleanupBeforeBuild()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AssetDatabase.ReleaseCachedFileHandles();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GC.Collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自托管 Runner 是另一个重要的加速手段。云端 CI 每次启动都是全新的环境，而自托管 Runner 可以保持 Library 缓存和 Unity Accelerator 的本地数据，大幅减少资源导入时间。对于需要频繁构建的团队，投资自托管硬件的回报非常显著。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((CI/CD 自动化))&#10;    CI 平台&#10;      GitHub Actions + GameCI&#10;      Unity Cloud Build&#10;      Jenkins 自定义&#10;    构建流程&#10;      测试 → 构建 → 部署&#10;      License 管理&#10;      多平台并行构建&#10;    测试集成&#10;      EditMode 单元测试&#10;      PlayMode 集成测试&#10;      测试报告收集&#10;    版本管理&#10;      语义化版本&#10;      构建号自增&#10;      Git 标签触发&#10;    构建加速&#10;      Library 缓存&#10;      Unity Accelerator&#10;      自托管 Runner\">mindmap\n  root((CI/CD 自动化))\n    CI 平台\n      GitHub Actions + GameCI\n      Unity Cloud Build\n      Jenkins 自定义\n    构建流程\n      测试 → 构建 → 部署\n      License 管理\n      多平台并行构建\n    测试集成\n      EditMode 单元测试\n      PlayMode 集成测试\n      测试报告收集\n    版本管理\n      语义化版本\n      构建号自增\n      Git 标签触发\n    构建加速\n      Library 缓存\n      Unity Accelerator\n      自托管 Runner</pre><ul>\n<li>CI/CD 将 Unity 构建、测试、发布流程自动化，GitHub Actions + GameCI 是最流行的方案</li>\n<li>Library 缓存是加速构建的第一优先级，配合 Unity Accelerator 可缩短 50-80% 增量构建时间</li>\n<li>Unity Test Framework 支持 EditMode 和 PlayMode 测试，CI 中自动运行可前置发现回归</li>\n<li>自动化版本管理通过环境变量注入版本号，配合 Git 标签触发发布构建</li>\n<li>Fastlane 集成实现 Google Play 和 App Store 的自动化发布</li>\n<li>自托管 Runner 保持本地缓存，是高频构建团队的最佳投资</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI/CD 自动化","id":"ci-cd-自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Actions 工作流","id":"github-actions-工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化测试集成","id":"自动化测试集成"},{"level":2,"text":"版本管理与发布自动化","id":"版本管理与发布自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"构建缓存与加速策略","id":"构建缓存与加速策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Addressables 资源管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-publishing/addressables"},"next":null}